<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<title>Proven report: @@TITLE@@</title>
<!-- A template. lab/seed/report.sh fills every marked place and writes one page per demo pull request into the lab's page
     volume. The page holds no script and no remote address, and nothing of the lab's settings: it is the review Proven wrote, set in the way
     GitHub shows a Markdown comment. Light and dark follow the reader's system. -->
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light dark;
    --bg:#ffffff; --canvas:#f6f8fa; --fg:#1f2328; --muted:#59636e; --border:#d1d9e0; --border-muted:#d1d9e0b3;
    --link:#0969da; --code-bg:#818b981f;
    --ok:#1a7f37; --ok-bg:#dafbe1; --ok-border:#4ac26b66;
    --bad:#d1242f; --bad-bg:#ffebe9; --bad-border:#ff818266;
    --warn:#9a6700; --warn-bg:#fff8c5; --warn-border:#d4a72c66;
    --neutral:#59636e; --neutral-bg:#eaeef2;
    --sans:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","Noto Sans",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    --mono:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,"SF Mono",Menlo,Consolas,"Liberation Mono",monospace;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg:#0d1117; --canvas:#151b23; --fg:#f0f6fc; --muted:#9198a1; --border:#3d444d; --border-muted:#3d444db3;
      --link:#4493f8; --code-bg:#656c7633;
      --ok:#3fb950; --ok-bg:#2ea04326; --ok-border:#2ea04366;
      --bad:#f85149; --bad-bg:#f8514926; --bad-border:#f8514966;
      --warn:#d29922; --warn-bg:#bb800926; --warn-border:#bb800966;
      --neutral:#9198a1; --neutral-bg:#656c7633;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  body { margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--fg); font:16px/1.5 var(--sans); }
  .top { background:var(--canvas); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
  .top .in, .wrap { max-width:1012px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px; }
  .top .in { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; height:56px; font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); }
  .top b { color:var(--fg); }
  a { color:var(--link); text-decoration:none; }
  a:hover { text-decoration:underline; }
  .wrap { padding-top:24px; padding-bottom:56px; }
  h1 { font-size:2rem; font-weight:400; line-height:1.25; margin:0 0 8px; }
  h1 .num { color:var(--muted); font-weight:300; }
  .meta { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin:0 0 24px; padding-bottom:16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; }
  .badge { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-weight:600; font-size:14px; line-height:20px; padding:4px 12px; border-radius:2em; color:#fff; }
  .badge.bad { background:#cf222e; }
  .badge.ok { background:#1f883d; }
  .badge.neutral { background:#6e7781; }
  .note { margin:0 0 16px; padding:12px 16px; border:1px solid var(--warn-border); background:var(--warn-bg); color:var(--fg); border-radius:6px; font-size:14px; }
  .comment { border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px; }
  .comment .head { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:8px 16px; background:var(--canvas); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px 6px 0 0; font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); }
  .comment .head b { color:var(--fg); }
  .avatar { width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--neutral-bg); color:var(--fg); display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font:600 11px var(--sans); }
  .label { font-size:12px; line-height:18px; padding:0 7px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:2em; color:var(--muted); }
  .markdown-body { padding:16px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; overflow-wrap:break-word; }
  .markdown-body > :first-child { margin-top:0; }
  .markdown-body > :last-child { margin-bottom:0; }
  .markdown-body p, .markdown-body ul, .markdown-body details, .markdown-body pre, .markdown-body .table-wrap { margin:0 0 16px; }
  .markdown-body ul { padding-left:2em; }
  .markdown-body li + li { margin-top:.25em; }
  .markdown-body code { font:85% var(--mono); background:var(--code-bg); border-radius:6px; padding:.2em .4em; }
  .markdown-body pre { background:var(--canvas); border-radius:6px; padding:16px; overflow:auto; font:85%/1.45 var(--mono); }
  .markdown-body pre code { background:transparent; padding:0; font-size:100%; white-space:pre; }
  .markdown-body .table-wrap { overflow-x:auto; }
  .markdown-body table { border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:0; width:max-content; max-width:100%; }
  .markdown-body th, .markdown-body td { padding:6px 13px; border:1px solid var(--border); text-align:left; vertical-align:top; }
  .markdown-body th { font-weight:600; }
  .markdown-body tr { background:var(--bg); border-top:1px solid var(--border-muted); }
  .markdown-body tr:nth-child(2n) { background:var(--canvas); }
  .markdown-body td.sev { font-weight:600; }
  .markdown-body td.sev-error { color:var(--bad); }
  .markdown-body td.sev-warning { color:var(--warn); }
  .markdown-body td.sev-info { color:var(--link); }
  .markdown-body details { border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px; padding:0; }
  .markdown-body details > summary { cursor:pointer; padding:8px 16px; font-weight:600; background:var(--canvas); border-radius:6px; list-style-position:inside; }
  .markdown-body details[open] > summary { border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px 6px 0 0; }
  .markdown-body details > :not(summary) { margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px; }
  .markdown-body details > summary + * { margin-top:16px; }
  .markdown-body details > :last-child { margin-bottom:16px; }
  .markdown-body .foot { color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; margin-top:16px; padding-top:12px; border-top:1px solid var(--border-muted); }
  footer { margin-top:24px; color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="top"><div class="in"><b>Proven</b><span>report for a demo pull request</span><span style="flex:1"></span><a href="@@LAB_PAGE_URL@@">&larr; the lab</a></div></div>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>@@TITLE@@ <span class="num">#@@NUM@@</span></h1>
  <div class="meta">
    <span class="badge @@BADGE_CLASS@@">@@BADGE_TEXT@@</span>
    <span>Demo pull request #@@NUM@@ in <a href="@@PR_URL@@">the lab's Gitea</a></span>
  </div>
@@NOTE@@
  <div class="comment">
    <div class="head"><span class="avatar">P</span><b>proven</b><span class="label">bot</span><span>reviewed this change</span></div>
    <div class="markdown-body">
@@BODY@@
    </div>
  </div>
  <footer>The review as Proven wrote it with <code>proven scan --md</code>. Open a block to read its evidence.</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
